{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2d puzzle game in a world of arrows! It's a sokoban-like block pushing game with a simple twist; Instead\u00a0of boxes,\u00a0you have\u00a0to deal with arrows\u00a0that\u00a0move\u00a0toward their pointed directions. You play as a single arrow whose goal is to move all the colored arrows to their corresponding goals. The colored arrows move forward if nothing's in the way, and stop if an object blocks their path (except for some specific circumstances...). A seemingly simple world hides a complex mechanism that gradually reveals itself as you progress further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633540/extras/2f7704f8b1feb3b80fbdea794f8282a2.poster.avif?t=1773152319\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633540/extras/2f7704f8b1feb3b80fbdea794f8282a2.webm?t=1773152319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level contains a unique challenge that will deepen your understanding of the game and equip you with new skills. If you love puzzle games like Stephen's\u00a0Sausage\u00a0Roll,\u00a0Snakebird\u00a0or\u00a0Jelly\u00a0No\u00a0Puzzle then\u00a0this is for you\u00a0:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633540/extras/4e21f7bb223fbd6d36a53d8700124045.poster.avif?t=1773152319\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633540/extras/4e21f7bb223fbd6d36a53d8700124045.webm?t=1773152319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an arrow and help your fellow arrows get to their goal. Play with your friends and family and try to make it to the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Notes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 82 levels/puzzles in\u00a0the\u00a0game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game only supports\u00a0Windows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Notes on the Demo: </strong>The demo has six levels. Only the last level is included in the full game. The\u00a0rest\u00a0are\u00a0exclusive\u00a0to\u00a0the\u00a0demo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow me on social\u00a0media\u00a0for news,\u00a0updates,\u00a0and behind-the-scenes\u00a0:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instagram / Twitter / Bluesky: @dongchagames</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner's Island","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3633540/fec44d3effad1e47bfcc3a9c94ecfd2eb67cee95.jpg"},{"name":"Sacred Temple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3633540/56b946ac94e98ebd74922bdd70276d57f6df996e.jpg"},{"name":"Death Valley","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3633540/118e9c42f33f6f89b93a1af48a219768a05697f5.jpg"},{"name":"The Village","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3633540/0c1306895003a13b1eb7d415dbe06fb4a9083b5c.jpg"},{"name":"Springland","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3633540/4307096998a845bb25c76c5ce0da5cecfe74c4bd.jpg"},{"name":"Forbidden Temple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3633540/9c4c589ce265f4106a7ebb10ad9cd1f8dfc3b23b.jpg"},{"name":"The Tower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunit